      "letter": "My Kuchuuu,\n\nI hope you learn to recognise which things deserve your energy and which things are better left behind.\n\nNot every careless comment needs a long argument. Not every small mistake needs to become a serious disagreement. And not every irritating habit needs to occupy your thoughts.\n\nSometimes people make mistakes without intending to hurt you.\n\nGive room for that possibility, my love.\n\nOf course, when something genuinely matters, speak about it. Don’t keep quiet about things that repeatedly hurt you.\n\nBut for the little things, I hope you find the freedom to let them pass without carrying them around.\n\nYour peace is precious. Spend your energy wisely.\n\nYour Kishmish ♡"
