      "explanation": "Gratitude becomes meaningful when it comes from the whole heart. This verse encourages us not only to remember God’s goodness privately, but also to acknowledge it. Even when we cannot explain everything happening in our lives, we can still recognise the wonderful things God has done.",
      "letter": "My Gulaabiiii,\n\nI hope you never become so occupied with everything you’re waiting for that you forget to appreciate everything you’ve already been given.\n\nLook at how far you’ve come, my love. Think about the little moments that made you smile, the difficult days you managed to get through, the people who stayed and the prayers that quietly found their answers.\n\nYou don’t have to wait for something extraordinary to happen before you thank God.\n\nSometimes the most beautiful blessings are the ones we have become so familiar with that we barely notice them anymore.\n\nI hope you always find reasons to look up and say, “Thank You, God.”\n\nYour Kishmish ♡"
