      "letter": "My little one,\n\nThere will be days when you understand everything and days when you won’t understand much at all.\n\nThere will be moments when you feel incredibly blessed and moments when you wonder why things have to be so difficult.\n\nBut through all of it, I hope you remember that God’s goodness is not measured by how perfect your day has been.\n\nHis mercy is not something you have to earn by being flawless.\n\nYou can come to Him with your happiness, your mistakes, your questions and your tired little heart.\n\nI hope that thought always gives you a reason to be thankful.\n\nYour Kishmish ♡"
